  "details": "Assuming a world has a Quest and PC version: add a toggle on the website to allow for a world to be marked as Quest-only, PC-only or both.\nReasons to want to do this:\n1. You broke one or the other version of the world and want to stop the broken version being used whilst you fix it.\n2. You are rolling back from supporting both platforms for technical reasons (like a new essential feature that is PC-only) and don't want to support one or the other anymore.",
